# Everything under .claude/ is local tooling, not part of the application.
# There was once a `!.claude/skills/` negation here so one skill could be
# versioned. It un-ignored the whole tree rather than just the code in it,
# and the skill's scoutmaster directory -- names, units, and 45 email
# addresses -- rode in behind it. The skill lives on disk only now.
.claude/

# The inherited binary stays out of git entirely: it embeds a SignUpGenius
# API key in its web resources. Local copies live at the repo root (runtime)
# and in original/ (archival); PROVENANCE.md records its SHA-256.
/EagleBoardScheduler_20190618.jar
original/

